# Schema: Polkadot SDK PRDoc Schema (prdoc) v1.0.0
# See doc at https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/master/prdoc/schema_user.json

title: Refactor indices pallet to use fungible traits instead of Currency

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      The indices pallet now uses the modern `fungible` traits (`Inspect`, `Mutate`,
      `InspectHold`, `MutateHold`) instead of the deprecated `Currency` / `ReservableCurrency`
      traits. Deposits are now managed via hold/release with a `HoldReason::DepositForIndex`
      reason instead of reserve/unreserve.

      Breaking change: the `Config` trait replaces `type Currency` with `type NativeBalance`.
      Runtimes must update their indices configuration accordingly:
      ```rust
      // Before
      type Currency = Balances;
      // After
      type NativeBalance = Balances;
      ```

      A new `poke_deposit` extrinsic (call_index 5) is added, allowing index owners to
      adjust their deposit if the configured deposit amount has changed.

      A multi-block stepped migration (`MigrateCurrencyToFungibles`) is provided to convert
      existing reserved deposits to holds. Runtimes with `pallet_migrations` should register
      it in their `Migrations` tuple.

migrations:
  runtime:
    - reference: pallet_indices::migration::v1::MigrateCurrencyToFungibles
      description: |
        Stepped multi-block migration that converts index deposits from Currency::reserve
        to fungible::hold with HoldReason::DepositForIndex. Iterates through all Accounts
        storage entries, unreserves the old deposit, and creates a new hold. Preserves index
        relationships with zero deposits on hold failure to avoid breaking user access.

crates:
  - name: pallet-indices
    bump: major
    note: "Config trait replaces `type Currency` with `type NativeBalance` using fungible traits"
  - name: westend-runtime
    bump: major
  - name: rococo-runtime
    bump: major
  - name: polkadot-test-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
    bump: major
  - name: kitchensink-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: pallet-staking-async-rc-runtime
    bump: patch
